# Golden set 2 (2026-10-19): set 1 again from the runner account, with the
# collectors' copies and content ids in each recipe, $HOME for host paths,
# HTTP.sys tables in loot-host, DC promotion checked, DC-role jobs one at a
# time, and Exchange SE on a 2022 DC. Replaces set 1 (whose win2022 dc and ca
# runs were not DCs). Not here: the internet-connected ssh-egress run.
# NAME ENV=VALUE ... ; run by bin/run-list.sh.

# First, so its ~3 h start early (DC-role jobs run one at a time).
